    {
      "type": "point",
      "title": "⭐ Good to know",
      "html": "The Hijri year is a <b>lunar</b> (moon) year of about <b>355 days</b>. The first day of the Hijri week is <b>Friday</b>. A day in the Hijri calendar starts at <b>sunset</b> and lasts until the next sunset."
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "title": "Greeting",
      "html": "We greet each other: <b>Blessed new Hijri year!</b>"
    }
